.SH DIAGNOSTICS
.I Mdedit
returns nil and sets the error string if the edit does not fit the texts' lengths.
.SH BUGS
APE has no
.IR md.h .
cmark's limit on the text that reference links may repeat is not applied,
so a document's links can expand to more than its size when a renderer repeats their destinations.
